<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n94841" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκί̆-ασμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>shadow cast</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς
			γῆς</span>, of eclipses, <i><span class="en">
				Gem.
				11.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				2.31
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Placit.</u>
				2.29.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Vett.Val.
				343.18
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>reflected image, shadow</i> in water, <i><span class="en">
				Callistr.
				<u>Stat.</u>
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκῐ-ασμός</span></b> , ὁ,= foreg. <i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Arat.
				872
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Vett.Val.
				241.27
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> a disease,
			perh. <i>specks before the eyes</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				210.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>visitation by a ghost</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκιά</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>PMag.Par.</u>
				1.2701
			</span></i>.</div>
